# The Claude Code commit trailer added itself to 22 commits as
# `Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>`. That email
# resolves to a real GitHub account, so the repository grew a second
# contributor who never wrote a line, has no key and opened no PR.
#
# Map the identity to the owner rather than rewriting history: 22 commits are
# already deployed and rewriting them would change every SHA.
noreply@anthropic.com vaskes <vaskes@kuduza.com>
# Three bot identities were committed against kuduza.ai, a domain that does
# not exist -- 231 commits in total. Nothing was lost, but the addresses are
# unroutable and unattributable. KuduzaAiLab owns kuduza.com; the repo owner
# is vaskes@kuduza.com.
mavis@kuduza.ai       vaskes <vaskes@kuduza.com>
mavis-agent@kuduza.ai vaskes <vaskes@kuduza.com>
llamabot@kuduza.ai    vaskes <vaskes@kuduza.com>
mavis@kuduza.com      vaskes <vaskes@kuduza.com>
